/// An OSR entry stub owes no seed to a primitive value that every reader the
/// entered path can reach before the value is computed again reads only as a
/// MEMORY TOKEN (`ir::is_memory_token_slot`): a volatile `getstatic` the
/// builder reuses as the memory chain's producer, whose only use past an
